				<wikidot:authorName>Port602</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4320137</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This chapter while amazing, I don't feel much for the difficult translation of Latin and the hard-set of why Google wants to kill a language that is literally being revived by human thought and dreams. If you want to use a more appropriate language I would use &quot;Drëëfo' Kreemàr&quot;, the dying language of Kings. Once was famous all over 6-16 century west Europe until the butchery of the New Testament was completed in 1508 by a mad sect of sexiest bigot clerics who deemed women an inter-sex slaves of men by divine right. That sect was fully destroyed yet the actions they did were absolutely irreversible even by the Pope's best blessings.<br /> If you all don't believe, that's okay but Christianity as a whole will die out and God will have to use another back-up plan.</p> 
				 	]]>
